</GuideCard>

<GuideCard Title="How field of view works:">
  <GuideInfoItem Title="Peripheral vision and memory" Description="Objects that leave your field of view smoothly fade out over a few seconds, while objects right next to you are visible from all sides."/>
  <GuideInfoItem Title="Equipment, scopes, and genetics" Description="Helmets, gas masks, welding masks, and aiming narrow your viewing angle, while some species and mutations widen it instead."/>
  <GuideInfoItem Title="Sound indicators" Description="Footsteps, speech, and attacks behind you are shown with brief visual markers so you can react in time."/>
</GuideCard>
